  (polyline (pts (xy 248.00 220.00) (xy 408.00 220.00) (xy 408.00 258.00) (xy 248.00 258.00) (xy 248.00 220.00)) (stroke (width 0.3) (type default)) (uuid "30921df8-42e2-5dba-87ae-675203eed89d"))
  (text "(1) One ATV320 output feeds both OLI MVE 400/6-HF motors. Each motor is 1.45 A.\n(2) Motor B swaps V and W at X3 so the motors turn in opposite directions.\n(3) OPEN: F21 and F22 need a PWM-rated protector. Do not fit a standard GV2.\n(4) The drive STO screw is one terminal. DI3 is the second channel. The SoMove parameter is TODO.\n(5) Do not tie P24 to the cabinet 24 V. PA, PB, PC and P0 stay open. There is no braking resistor.\n(6) R1C is the fault-relay common. R1B is the NC contact. R1A is open. The logic assignment is TODO.\n(7) RJ45 pin numbers are TBC. See the Modbus manual NVE41308.\n(8) Supply wire is 6 mm2. Each motor cable stays 4G1.5 shielded at the drive. The drive is below rated current.\nNets that leave this sheet are listed on the notes sheet." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 249.60 221.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "102a53b6-0129-58bb-9d49-2496083b1fec"))
